{
  "question": "How does the MFU E-Questionnaires system operate end-to-end across Form Creation (Wizard 5 steps), Policy-Guarded Form Filling, All 4 Dynamic Email Triggers (+ Per-Account Email Studio), Analytics Inspection, and All 6 Data Exports?",
  "audience": "Client Stakeholders, Project Owners, and Engineering Reviewers",
  "findings": [
    "response.js:240 invokes sendDynamicEmail(\"creatorNotification\", ...) while emailTemplateDefaults.js:64 stores template code \"ResponseNotification\"; dynamicEmail.js:119 aliases both codes so unaliased queries or direct DB edits must keep that mapping in mind.",
    "emailTemplate.js:245 resolves ownerEmail directly from authenticated user/DB and returns { sent: false } when MAIL_USER/MAIL_PASS SMTP credentials are not configured in development, requiring SMTP env config in production to deliver live mail.",
    "inviteOrganization.js:68 sends \"invitationOrganization\" only to newly added organizations while form schedule is Active; opening a draft/scheduled form later does not retroactively dispatch missed organization invitations.",
    "router/index.js:94 redirects legacy /permissions to ManageForms and TheSidebar.vue:126 exposes 4 main modules (/forms, /manage, /analytics, /email); fine-grained access is enforced per-form (collaborators/org/role) plus Admin global scope."
  ],
  "exceptions": [
    "FORM_DRAFT / FORM_SCHEDULED / FORM_CLOSED -> HTTP 40300 termination (responsePolicy.js:273)",
    "LOGIN_REQUIRED -> HTTP 40100 or ACCESS_DENIED_USER / ACCESS_DENIED_ROLE -> HTTP 40300 (responsePolicy.js:290)",
    "LIMIT_RESPONSE_REACHED -> HTTP 40900 or QUOTA_REACHED -> HTTP 40300 (responsePolicy.js:335)",
    "Unconfigured SMTP credentials -> preview verification without live mail dispatch (emailTemplate.js:270)",
    "Export API fallback -> client-side SheetJS/JSON fallback when network export endpoint fails (TabResponses.vue:482)"
  ],
